{"1059110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Superball", "steam_appid": 1059110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superball is a futuristic reimagining of football with fast-paced 3v3 matches full of action. Enter the field with a team of heroes, score against the other team while defending your own goal and win! Show your skill in classic matches, battle for the top spots in ranked games and have fun in arcade modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/7da6d4050deefdd3c70060e1b4061e61.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/504f7aa2bc3327147f81d8c6e7283b88.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/504f7aa2bc3327147f81d8c6e7283b88.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over a dozen characters to choose from, with a new hero joining the cast every season! Each character has a unique appearance, personality and a set of abilities, complete with a powerful ultimate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/3b6694e4543a2342d26b09e270286e0f.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/5141773fc8724fce3b5236bebd69d7d3.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/5141773fc8724fce3b5236bebd69d7d3.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings unique abilities to the field — but it's the way you combine them that sparks real magic. Will you pull off the highlight play, or end up on someone else's? That’s up to you, champ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/2821e769959d74d20b6a27e2b2fcfc01.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/8c9bcffd3caaa00d8e5e8f2ad160a409.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/8c9bcffd3caaa00d8e5e8f2ad160a409.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the flashiest hero has weaknesses. That’s where team synergy shines. In a 3-player squad, coordination is easier than ever. So grab your best buddies and get ready to climb to the top together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/bc48d99f176647ee430223a5cea952e8.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/11097a507f19c8e1d5758d96b8184c50.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/11097a507f19c8e1d5758d96b8184c50.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up the equipment and accessories of your heroes to create a look that is truly yours. Choose from hundreds of customization options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Superball — here, it's not luck that wins. It's skill. Are you ready to hit the field?</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superball is a futuristic reimagining of football with fast-paced 3v3 matches full of action. Enter the field with a team of heroes, score against the other team while defending your own goal and win! Show your skill in classic matches, battle for the top spots in ranked games and have fun in arcade modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/7da6d4050deefdd3c70060e1b4061e61.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/504f7aa2bc3327147f81d8c6e7283b88.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/504f7aa2bc3327147f81d8c6e7283b88.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over a dozen characters to choose from, with a new hero joining the cast every season! Each character has a unique appearance, personality and a set of abilities, complete with a powerful ultimate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/3b6694e4543a2342d26b09e270286e0f.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/5141773fc8724fce3b5236bebd69d7d3.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/5141773fc8724fce3b5236bebd69d7d3.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings unique abilities to the field — but it's the way you combine them that sparks real magic. Will you pull off the highlight play, or end up on someone else's? That’s up to you, champ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/2821e769959d74d20b6a27e2b2fcfc01.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/8c9bcffd3caaa00d8e5e8f2ad160a409.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/8c9bcffd3caaa00d8e5e8f2ad160a409.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the flashiest hero has weaknesses. That’s where team synergy shines. In a 3-player squad, coordination is easier than ever. So grab your best buddies and get ready to climb to the top together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/bc48d99f176647ee430223a5cea952e8.avif?t=1787896914\" width=600 height=71 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/11097a507f19c8e1d5758d96b8184c50.poster.avif?t=1787896914\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/11097a507f19c8e1d5758d96b8184c50.webm?t=1787896914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up the equipment and accessories of your heroes to create a look that is truly yours. Choose from hundreds of customization options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Superball — here, it's not luck that wins. It's skill. Are you ready to hit the field?</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Superball is a multiplayer 3v3 action game. An all-out blast of football in a cyberpunk setting. Choose a hero with unique abilities and conquer the sport of the future. Your accurate passes and strikes, as well as artful defense will lead your team to victory!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/7beb58e9ca4769c2440fc99ae3915d4c3e59e402/header.jpg?t=1787896914", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/c6e52beeb3590d198df5642cc56db263cc44a7dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787896914", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/c6e52beeb3590d198df5642cc56db263cc44a7dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787896914", "website": "https://sbt.patheagames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 